### 3. tsconfig.json 路径别名同步

```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["src/*"],
      "@components/*": ["src/components/*"],
      "@views/*": ["src/views/*"],
